      "hash": "2330131b5d9793d4023783aeceb087c7880f12ec9aeb2d9334466709764226a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "7b3133e2f122f8865be8a02c1f1f57c09fbe585ecfa0113b6de8b09d71e1f7f8",
      "text": "Contextual knowledge",
      "hash": "d6e7abe0383292e093bb86c7be9c6e2a5572caca8fa0e5265c6f14c196b0bd4f"
    },
    {
      "id": "61a67892ee553a9d3af5336053ca50b4eab8709ae1245828aa88c5695005f58b",
      "text": "Facts the agent can read directly from the context right now. Counterpart to parametric knowledge.",
      "hash": "73c00ed4b125d42a134ab302ad5bdfe555b1a597b851113d2c6e8b08763ef347"
    },
    {
      "id": "9647e11608f50b31bec7c01c419e124f607109dc2511912d8afe1cb0dbe42484",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "a823de3d0ae1a8d5eb42e664ef99d61ba6452c4ddadf0214fc638e70ce834cae",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "8fc3ce879a7ca4fd548aa0924f2b83fa90c66dbd602a19ffad20529915a3499a",
      "text": "Facts the",
      "hash": "154b03b9d9eab60b38616f5190349c8adb266a4720f7642c328273951f7b6dc0"
    },
    {
      "id": "1c27677d6e04d3569bed6b3b583b43783e781eec0176a0fd658d63aa72382c9a",
      "text": "can read directly from the",
      "hash": "a29eabdefb271f3c6535185bdf8af50d7843fbaf63ac0138cd64dd9e20b96875"
    },
    {
      "id": "be88819c49e25e80a30f5bf71b4c926dd97f6da60d89d8e5c6b70b22394cd14d",
      "text": "right now — the user's task, files the agent has read in,",
      "hash": "43db9b72e0ffacbbb03ea67eb502599a33e781360d012db6c21c121cc5a688bb"
    },
    {
      "id": "bcb611eaa4a839cdd5d5c3abf0e6aef2b02223c16551dd779b36538129f457bb",
      "text": "tool results",
      "hash": "a5594e12dfffd8e54c36d9b99bc31c7d41f0389d2251790338f34e836a3211fe"
    },
    {
      "id": "ac50e494230d46965fa31dd0c58e84035ec507f4b85f61bc15c77fce50a059a5",
      "text": "content loaded at",
      "hash": "83b90cfa48fe348e62687e8f9e1279229e1883963fbadd14820f3464cc04f2ec"
    },
    {
      "id": "b32adeebf5b48de4a26bfc2789c954f7f9b8980235d74c10b9e55d44f648cfd0",
      "text": "start. Counterpart to",
      "hash": "5d37972691a47f85aad00117e8d118ef5caed065718a269c25eb2b3cc3063cbf"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6466bb8d50b87739b5a135b541927144b8fe21d91eaaa6aa3f30ee75f20ef10",
      "text": "parametric knowledge",
      "hash": "af45e8f3199438ecb8e32a5842d362c9e1486e34f1b2d9374b547824e0ceb837"
    },
    {
      "id": "181a2212c7335371b67a5246b6105d7f26d90a1b9d4ca7d2367fe6212cb3fef6",
      "text": ": parametric is",
      "hash": "93987a4ffce3e6c20ea7b4c24b26f7020cb225c7df499f0708f7421399738d69"
    },
    {
      "id": "a602efa7e6adb3147ea9a50a388161f13975e37937b54e5c7f79ba05c2eb86f0",
      "text": "from the parameters; contextual is",
      "hash": "863a6cf7aa89bfa4332d110582998ade2cd5a4e1915fc8550bd537141d43073d"
    },
    {
      "id": "979865255c8a41e6d5728e998ae33014ae11cd764ae2a45f289b9753cd7cd6ff",
      "text": "from the",
      "hash": "4f56bf5fd8e4753ba57720268f0333576ac22c9387534579f73848a433d99a1b"
    },
    {
      "id": "8e13f4284e6665a02571ebff27ed048fd64537f9b1c7333c46191d2d1c8ab3f5",
      "text": "Hallucinations",
      "hash": "51e5f9cee92898df8c93730c2ca8b5154a37dba6f44f907c601733cfaf215288"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ef22a0140017166f44d3d562049b373703ac9213b27a828ca911d42d8817c77",
      "text": "are much less common when the agent works from contextual knowledge — the answer is right in front of it, not dredged up from a blurred memory.",
      "hash": "ef3c0120de8924e4862ad86ef31cf1674e51c90a5583d2885ff882992b1583d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "0fdce7fab87e941b55763b6c67abbd98952b41c41d422de9acde7a6e7192560c",
      "text": "Of the two kinds of knowledge, only contextual knowledge is in your control. The parameters are frozen, so the only way to give the",
      "hash": "12f4af3935908d9631e98e5b3a627007b81ed169f4e6b8db7f7c0415e232bf30"
    },
    {
      "id": "21379c5f5404b56cc1cf8bfba56949561eb5646bae61f60a80a6fc309cb49c38",
      "text": "knowledge it lacks — an internal SDK, a library released after the",
      "hash": "23f7f3488d44c9ffdeb0446e99a3a5817ad595dc24c3963b127fd11664bd3226"
    },
    {
      "id": "2a78c5e4301325fab986381fba135e623748cf259b53fc8c2ce7084e4f7ba121",
      "text": "knowledge cutoff",
      "hash": "46f1820f6339cd5450653d0018ffb90af1d929a074ed2e211dfa39e52b7cc408"
    },
    {
      "id": "3a71b25facf9d2a95f763e298e166f9b45c98de84874e4e2fc016802519278c0",
      "text": ", a decision made yesterday — is to put it in the context. A lot of practical",
      "hash": "ac1b8671ae703baf2c1aa16febaa028147ee4cfb1fdf33b94ccf7b23326625dd"
    },
    {
      "id": "8b9b097266e2f04916b4dfd441488e453f00e393a79ba8533dfc72b1e65643af",
      "text": "coding work reduces to this: getting the right facts in front of the model at the moment it needs them.",
      "hash": "86f8d722a960c8a85bbabe88f1256ffe48db214fed10c25da2d23f095a83a1ae"
    },
    {
      "id": "567e5ae11123877bb7e754c78c501c5815aff9443b9435080fad82c8741d9c6e",
      "text": "When contextual and parametric knowledge conflict, the contextual usually wins. Paste the current API docs and the model follows them rather than its stale memory of the old API — though the old version can still bleed through, especially deep into a long session. If the agent keeps reverting to an outdated pattern despite the docs being loaded, that's parametric knowledge leaking past the contextual; restating the correction or moving it closer to the work helps.",
      "hash": "8e054b6e88f40aa7d902e691b77f4bcbfe5439a81a67476be4573f0f75af8538"
    },
    {
      "id": "4073e991317ef50f15dbd6ab10f6dd8d86219dbc9c6806a4db6a3e6557e56652",
      "text": "Unlike parametric knowledge, contextual knowledge costs something to use. Everything loaded into the window spends",
      "hash": "8a9a283aea7cc81f6b4c83a57a6afbe3ae065bac575330a96489573c701cd17d"
    },
    {
      "id": "cae2a70cf803a3813da396d6a1c2424d4c1ad11b5f73ede78ff07b076ae66858",
      "text": "and competes for the model's",
      "hash": "aa85115cece46406f805a2c5085248fea9740b5096931bd2ede23e5e175ccfc2"
    },
    {
      "id": "b3d1867a66826f7e7216d130f6fcfbee23497c02860586935f512705ea669dcb",
      "text": "attention budget",
      "hash": "4f0ecd6ea97f18771cbd4203a929018449d8dbd4c6cce6f90fd7511b5c34cc81"
    },
    {
      "id": "0a52854c3a329db8b2a28b03c5d90d5d00088affdff75ccc0d84bc553d7f17d3",
      "text": ", so loading more is not automatically better — the aim is the relevant facts in the window, not all the facts.",
      "hash": "a0cf4bed2f7cdd6f4f70fee09075522024c3fd70632515e971c402f7c17e6f4f"
    },
    {
      "id": "0bcae47b43bfb6176a0ada7bc9fa9763b09ce1a2c3e2468899d02eca44f6759b",
      "text": "Reach for this term",
      "hash": "b33179c4ccbcb441a97156de3308e5004745922eeccf4d3576e408777255948e"
    },
    {
      "id": "0179d3f7e233109ec1084cbd2d8327101e46a0c2f2daba40de23aa8bbda82036",
      "text": "only when contrasting with parametric knowledge; otherwise just say",
      "hash": "907532fe6eb9f9338d6c3556c3af9e11994a9d942b74c05319f3ad7dc716aac2"
    },
    {
      "id": "1436a114934b49f34539bc89c3fdd623100b10bd0cc0e3c4c47b7f2e6115b3f9",
      "text": "Avoid:",
      "hash": "0c98d3dd1920fdb71269240ba1ce3a7323099760ecd0b295f071aca6b07e30df"
    },
    {
      "id": "1cd6339fbc270292b1622af6c44d7610afb3b9fd8d94c654efec7356dcea94a3",
      "text": "\"working memory\" — contextual knowledge is what's in the window",
      "hash": "dfdf2d4fecc0680c75b2eec37a5ce607f199d8ea987af1e7c072c591a1bbd108"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb90326b85ec4b3b23a978dafadc28722ca8795f37f53305f803b4ee3f32e424",
      "text": "; a",
      "hash": "eac5668a91b57ee54ef2c528536cadac6ec07af7312a00144a910af4707bae2e"
    },
    {
      "id": "68c7081608a946edada25603229dec8492b2c044b90ca16454c577b34ef07b01",
      "text": "memory system",
      "hash": "e89086a24d844403482b5bbecd8bfa90d974a15a37aba1fb8ca8206a143f75f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "b7de4734c262509c991c497c80ba26ef464314292a3f57c2a6d21a0c2d570273",
      "text": "is what gets cross-session content into it. Different scales, don't conflate.",
      "hash": "3bd2af6ea6402c6c762c25731b2ec7507191f5b67e1abca146a718536db8ba70"
    },
    {
      "id": "b084c301de1a1f3d1686854044242e95f18f7ea9d8abc67e95300ce51cfae98c",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "373d39509d24936d96a0847e28c1d71709f815cdc1cdc57e3000c58e7f451485",
      "text": "\"Why does it nail the API when I paste the docs and fabricate it when I don't?\"",
      "hash": "ce94bfee84316e483e99dd7109957f6c7f6038bb74aac66b0807194ef65a8b19"
    },
    {
      "id": "4f3943d6fbcb13858fd83720f2c208757c7fe867ca0b07bc4898213c09d7b4a7",
      "text": "\"With the docs in, it's contextual knowledge — reading off the page. Without, it's parametric and the rare endpoints blur.\"",
      "hash": "a8d4fd2d3333729d1f111fc2b9a196d6debbbf472c093f6ccc68741f285f4c90"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4e061e1d3adfe8b782d7d749ebbbd287f5e9d5f88de32514eaf6a469435856b",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "6d5d3ee14c2fef4760082344e88f7e3a7ccc9f51a47f797ea5ca13a0bcf22931",
      "text": "Knowledge cutoff",
      "hash": "da7752dcbdc5ec6cb75299abd8a5293085358a207b7a1383db9e1ce36002d71f"
    },
    {
      "id": "51c526225feede8707d2f522afbf15c4edb4932af9e3a9d35d5e3322509be02a",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "cc1811fee384b33569d99cb51348999af66ce4b479b0fed1044f3b2dc362e9cd",
      "text": "Attention relationship",
      "hash": "3326352af9343a5dd603549ddc399a87efaec24216defa5bbbf745688a6eb302"
    },
    {
      "id": "fd7fe60ad63e84c08006949758fb7918452a4bff4aab9c67c5fbc9d74df433b9",
      "text": "Want more than vocabulary?",
      "hash": "5d5500a083006a1606e84a03c018904d01364631c6baea4c7a3f8f3f62bf94dc"
    },
    {
      "id": "5fe95d7a36f6ef1da26e092493e5e1ab4e792166e06ebc6c61deb68aa68fbe80",
      "text": "Join AI Hero for practical skills, thinking on AI engineering, and resources that keep you ahead of the curve.",
      "hash": "a082f7147e30da6afe92268d5668a530edfff13e64934f8f63f22c098db86133"
    },
    {
      "id": "d808b1f86bbaab5c24381b93186594a33acdeec679a8c6c436355dae9cfd607b",
      "text": "First Name",
      "hash": "96ce6e6193a047260f5c32aa416d88b6e8959111f43f98457af9cc009a0907ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4c904c18b0c5d3b23719b55d2cbd6b72cccf429642355afb768c823a92f5c6a",
      "text": "Email*",
      "hash": "61dff02026341a6e553a56fc2ba214a76ad68c18cc67bf732993cfdbd51bb8b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "4a822046067d8da1ad9a0905906342171c60b8eebb1f6c9290d331c36d012d74",
      "text": "Get AI Hero updates",
      "hash": "81b46eab414c141d6dcd85a5bd534179bf54a3532469436d693c437e9de3a90a"
    },
    {
      "id": "9b3ae9931686b919c35ca757564c7f0b73cdb0b8fc767fab1392b62092c60568",
      "text": "No spam. Unsubscribe anytime.",
      "hash": "461f8758206b36fd4ddfaf6740b33dc0de41c9c7acb9121525993b781d5e18bb"
    },
    {
      "id": "2cdf95052353e5e531cf47f875f7aa3c5e612c01b433c7b555f26635668d794d",
      "text": "Share",
      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
    {
      "id": "e620993f9daf4a1c96505ed2d8833612cdfc61a8ac9060bebb44e8bb50163fe1",
      "text": "Copy URL",
      "hash": "b26d1037f1c2da31a0296d915982f12049f91bfedb998b105ce967b73a796699"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3a50a0010031dd7b9c8252e2716601b18137495c0f634a62c20730761b6a3cb",
      "text": "Learn",
      "hash": "ce78afd0e6a225ecac96a6812b9d192e7eb35889cd5237beb38b50375b79d8dd"
    },
    {
      "id": "5157c3fafe26079f0a06503a0ba3d450dbab07c47396324699d23f2068041f7e",
      "text": "AI SDK v6 Crash Course",
      "hash": "71139c58dab0fc6fcc2f49d2d44fd5b7c9e9e6e7fbf043ec2f4b51758b1b82b1"
    },
    {
      "id": "7d00357e2302f0f4e51a05ffbce2ffb6b0aca3e43ce12cfaea971d00ae394650",
      "text": "The AI Engineer Roadmap",
      "hash": "0ecca41f97662f50fc4210f00b4d05ed73257d862ecbd642b906cd7da42d4092"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3343b1ee10ee8fa4a943a7492ff4231a7d1240bfe67521521782c68f0696997",
      "text": "Vercel AI SDK Tutorial",
      "hash": "2f2904108d573c969e5838280a3b2a087d103fdf0b462b1707035a6d6da2d62c"
    },
    {
      "id": "48372374e803d6a0a941d1636c7e5d5e080e05fb930bd972f1bc36e7a31418e3",
      "text": "Model Context Protocol Tutorial",
      "hash": "d52bb57113ca725e4597402d041c46eaea7dad7dd40c1f6c374b03c1576d396e"
    },
    {
